{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_004_01_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:fcf75292fe9ec092b516c40bb34852e8a82d182c1d23d5d99fe81a6b3e317d12",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_e:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a056ee1720f5a730b4209cab657cf7f30f09a68ea64d0873fb310af9121046a",
      "text": "你在说什么啊！\n这种事情还是要公私分明的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_e:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed5bd8ea3a64f673480c139b5b468c517f0f2b9e13cce62af4abef73f56a091e",
      "text": "不，我一直想为辉先生\n成为偶像送一份贺礼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_e:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef3f488485f071250ff46aa63726d2115b4c837e11c723503301e91672121804",
      "text": "而且我也希望制作人今后能继续\n和辉先生一起加油。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a9263f1dbe0dc073999dd34e18720eb0cc063945d5bfdfd8e619f7bdfd84307",
      "text": "请收下我为二位送上的\n这份心意与应援吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bb88e9257b81624e30f97eaeb3df76c7caf3d3a9e80a08e932fbbb653433300",
      "text": "老爷子……好吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae6987c9c7a41d3fb7270ce1183cf44cfdc2540a1c6d79d551d98e61fafa65c3",
      "text": "既然这样，那我们就恭敬不如从命了。\n……谢谢你！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_e:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57d629f6ab55439a684fca7a4eeaf11a5b93ecb08f58d76ae689cc1d8b0e403c",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。穿上老爷子做的\n西装，我们就如虎添翼了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e313cb77af9990ff01403b9ba4d42b0386aee4264f314de3818a2054b0feae6b",
      "text": "是啊。无论发生什么，我都会全力支持辉先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:059005dffc1eded9d8df986bbbc05810b3add8db0afffdd1a07c711355050249",
      "text": "我也会用不输给你的制作力量\n来全力回应你的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0fc759f18c6051b52802ab6695f9b8907686348d7c998f99d291c8b9568d062",
      "text": "做好了之后，再一起过来取吧。\n真期待穿上的那一天啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
